<title>USA: Hillsborough Cty, Fla., repriced, 2002 yield cut.</title>
<headline>Hillsborough Cty, Fla., repriced, 2002 yield cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>PaineWebber Inc said Monday it repriced Hillsborough County, Fla.'s $70 million school bond deal, lowering the yield in 2002 to 4.45 percent from 4.50 percent.</p>
<p>The repricing follows:  </p>
<p>SCHOOL BOARD OF HILLSBOROUGH COUNTY, FLORIDA</p>
<p>RE: $70,000,000*</p>
<p>SALES TAX REVENUE BONDS, SERIES 1996</p>
<p>REGISTERED</p>
<p>NOTE REPRICING.</p>
<p>VERBAL AWARD.</p>
<p>  MOODY'S: Aaa		 S&amp;P: NAF		   FITCH: AAA</p>
<p>AMBAC INSURED</p>
<p>  DATED: 12/01/1996	  FIRST COUPON: 04/01/1997</p>
<p>DUE: 10/01</p>
<p> MATURITY		AMOUNT*    COUPON	   PRICE</p>
<p>10/01/1997		4,000M    5.00  %     SEALED BID</p>
<p>10/01/1998		8,110M    5.00  %     SEALED BID</p>
<p>10/01/1999		8,515M    5.00  %	  4.05</p>
<p>10/01/2000		8,945M    4.125 %	  4.20</p>
<p>10/01/2001		9,390M    4.00  %	  4.35</p>
<p>------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>10/01/2002		9,860M    5.00  %	  4.45</p>
<p>10/01/2003	     10,350M    4.50  %	  4.70</p>
<p>10/01/2004	     10,830M    4.60  %	  4.80</p>
<p>CALL FEATURES: 2003-2004 CALLABLE ANYTIME AT PAR STARTING 01/01/1997.</p>
<p>		   1997-2002 NON-CALLABLE.</p>
<p>* - APPROXIMATE SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
<p>The compliance addendum MSRB Rule G-11 will apply.</p>
<p>The award is expected Tuesday, December 10, 1996.</p>
<p>Delivery is expected on December 23, 1996.</p>
<p>This issue is not book entry.</p>
<p>This issue is clearing through DTC.</p>
<p>PaineWebber Incorporated</p>
<p>Smith Barney Inc.</p>
<p>Raymond, James &amp; Associates, Inc.</p>
<p>Apex Securities, Inc.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
